Get ready for rush hour.

2
00:08:55,384 --> 00:09:01,384
Speed is a action, thriller film directed by Jan de Bont.

3
00:13:23,076 --> 00:13:29,076
Tensions run high when a crazed bomber rigs a Los Angeles bus with a device that will kill
everyone on board if the vehicle's speed dips below fifty miles per hour.

4
