Jack Traven, played by Keanu Reeves.

5
00:22:18,461 --> 00:22:24,461
Howard Payne, played by Dennis Hopper.

6
00:26:46,153 --> 00:26:52,153
Annie, played by Sandra Bullock.

7
00:31:13,846 --> 00:31:19,846
Capt. McMahon, played by Joe Morton.

8
